flowchart TD
    classDef startEnd fill:#98D8C8,stroke:#27AE60,stroke-width:3px
    classDef process fill:#87CEEB,stroke:#4682B4,stroke-width:2px
    classDef decision fill:#FFD700,stroke:#DAA520,stroke-width:2px
    classDef error fill:#FFB6C1,stroke:#DC143C,stroke-width:2px

    Start([Start]):::startEnd --> Check{Input Valid?}:::decision
    Check -->|Yes| Process[Process Data]:::process
    Check -->|No| Err[Show Error]:::error
    Process --> Done([Done]):::startEnd
    Err --> Check
